_:n9ed5fdded5c049e1a3e6a7febe0b73a3b1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/representsService> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "represents data service"@en .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/ingestedAt> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "원본 메타데이터를 가져온 시각."@ko .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/CatalogEntry> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class> .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/representsService> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/> .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/CatalogEntry> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "카탈로그에 등록된 데이터 하나를 나타내는 항목. 원본 메타데이터를 그대로 보존하면서 제목·발행자·주제 같은 공통 속성을 DCAT 어휘로 함께 표현하고, 원본 속성 항목(MetadataEntry)과 속성 매핑 관계(ColumnRelation)를 연결하는 기준이 된다."@ko .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/hasColumnRelation> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/forEntry> .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/priority> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "같은 표준 속성에 대응되는 매핑들 사이의 순서. 숫자가 작을수록 우선한다."@ko .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/representsService> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The dcat:DataService this entry represents."@en .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/representsDataset> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "대응 데이터셋"@ko .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/ofEntry> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "of entry"@en .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/hasColumnRelation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/ingestedAt> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/targetProperty> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "target property"@en .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/targetProperty> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "원본 속성이 대응되는 표준 속성. 예: dct:title, dcat:theme."@ko .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/CatalogEntry> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "카탈로그엔트리"@ko .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/CatalogEntry> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "One catalogued data item. It keeps the original metadata intact, exposes common properties (title, publisher, theme, …) in DCAT terms, and anchors the item's metadata entries and column relations."@en .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/similarityScore> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "원본 속성과 표준 속성이 얼마나 같은지를 나타내는 0.0~1.0 사이의 값. 1.0은 완전히 같음, 값이 낮을수록 이름이나 구조의 차이가 크다."@ko .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/hasMetadataEntry> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/CatalogEntry> .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/evidence> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Why this mapping was decided: rules or dictionaries applied, candidates considered, recommendation and final decision, rule/model versions."@en .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/isPreferred> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "True when, among several original attributes mapped to the same standard property, this one supplies the representative value."@en .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/hasMetadataEntry> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A metadata entry belonging to this catalog entry."@en .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/hasColumnRelation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/CatalogEntry> .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/ColumnRelation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class> .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/hasColumnRelation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A column relation belonging to this catalog entry."@en .
