<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/CatalogEntry> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "One catalogued data item. It keeps the original metadata intact, exposes common properties (title, publisher, theme, …) in DCAT terms, and anchors the item's metadata entries and column relations."@en .
