<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "AMAP 능동형 메타데이터 응용 프로파일"@ko .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/representsDataset> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/CatalogEntry> .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/rawMetadata> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "원본 메타데이터 전문. JSON, XML 등 원본 형식의 문자열을 그대로 담는다."@ko .
