<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/evidence> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "이 매핑을 결정한 근거. 적용한 규칙이나 사전, 검토한 후보 목록, 추천과 최종 결정 내역, 규칙·모델 버전 등을 적는다."@ko .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/ColumnRelation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/> .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/targetProperty> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The standard property the original attribute maps to, e.g. dct:title or dcat:theme."@en .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/evidence> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/> .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/ingestedAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/sourcePath> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "원본 메타데이터 안에서 속성의 위치를 가리키는 경로. JSON이면 JSONPath, XML이면 XPath 식으로 쓴다. 원본 속성 항목과 매핑 관계가 같은 경로 값으로 서로 대응된다."@ko .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/CatalogEntry> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
_:n9ed5fdded5c049e1a3e6a7febe0b73a3b2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:n9ed5fdded5c049e1a3e6a7febe0b73a3b3 .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/isPreferred> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "같은 표준 속성에 여러 원본 속성이 대응될 때 대표값으로 쓰는 매핑이면 참. 예: 한국어 제목과 영어 제목이 모두 dct:title에 대응되면 기본 언어 쪽을 참으로 둔다."@ko .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "An extension of W3C DCAT 3.0 for representing heterogeneous source metadata in DCAT terms while preserving the original, and for recording how each original attribute maps to a standard property (similarity, preference, evidence)."@en .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/rawFormat> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/representsService> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "이 항목이 나타내는 데이터 서비스(dcat:DataService)."@ko .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/targetProperty> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/> .
