<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/rawFormat> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/priority> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "같은 표준 속성에 대응되는 매핑들 사이의 순서. 숫자가 작을수록 우선한다."@ko .
