<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/representsDataset> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/> .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/similarityScore> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal> .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/priority> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/> .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/evidence> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/ColumnRelation> .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/isPreferred> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "True when, among several original attributes mapped to the same standard property, this one supplies the representative value."@en .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/ColumnRelation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A mapping that states which standard property an original attribute corresponds to, with its source path, target property, similarity score, preference, priority and evidence."@en .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/ingestedAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "수집 시각"@ko .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/ofEntry> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/MetadataEntry> .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/isPreferred> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/targetProperty> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "원본 속성이 대응되는 표준 속성. 예: dct:title, dcat:theme."@ko .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "W3C DCAT 3.0을 확장한 어휘. 형식이 서로 다른 원본 메타데이터를 원본 그대로 보존하면서 DCAT 공통 속성으로 표현하고, 원본 속성과 표준 속성 사이의 매핑 관계(유사도, 대표값, 근거)를 기록할 수 있게 한다."@ko .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/isPreferred> <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> "testing" .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/priority> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Order among mappings to the same standard property; lower comes first."@en .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/evidence> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/hasMetadataEntry> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has metadata entry"@en .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/evidence> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "evidence"@en .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/similarityScore> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "원본 속성과 표준 속성이 얼마나 같은지를 나타내는 0.0~1.0 사이의 값. 1.0은 완전히 같음, 값이 낮을수록 이름이나 구조의 차이가 크다."@ko .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/hasColumnRelation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A column relation belonging to this catalog entry."@en .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/ingestedAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "When the original metadata was collected."@en .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/MetadataEntry> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "One attribute of the original metadata, recorded with its path in the source and its value. Source information that has no standard counterpart is kept here."@en .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/rawMetadata> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/isPreferred> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/> .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/rawMetadata> <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> "testing" .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/ingestedAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/CatalogEntry> .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/ColumnRelation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "원본 속성 하나가 어떤 표준 속성에 대응하는지를 기록한 매핑 관계. 원본 경로, 대상 표준 속성, 유사도 점수, 대표값 여부, 우선순위, 판단 근거를 담는다."@ko .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/hasColumnRelation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "컬럼관계 보유"@ko .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/representsService> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/ofEntry> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/priority> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/hasMetadataEntry> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/ofEntry> .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/sourcePath> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/forEntry> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/ofEntry> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "소속 카탈로그엔트리"@ko .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/MetadataEntry> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/rawMetadata> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "원본 메타데이터"@ko .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/rawMetadata> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The complete original metadata as a literal in its native format (JSON, XML, …)."@en .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/representsService> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "대응 데이터서비스"@ko .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/sourcePath> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "source path"@en .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/value> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "원본 값"@ko .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/ColumnRelation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A mapping that states which standard property an original attribute corresponds to, with its source path, target property, similarity score, preference, priority and evidence."@en .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/rawMetadata> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/> .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/ingestedAt> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "When the original metadata was collected."@en .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/updatedAt> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/MetadataEntry> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "메타데이터엔트리"@ko .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/updatedAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "When the original metadata was last changed."@en .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/hasColumnRelation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "카탈로그엔트리가 가진 속성 매핑 관계."@ko .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/similarityScore> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "How closely the original attribute matches the standard property, from 0.0 to 1.0; 1.0 means identical."@en .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/ColumnRelation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Column Relation"@en .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/ingestedAt> <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> "testing" .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/priority> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "우선순위"@ko .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/evidence> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "이 매핑을 결정한 근거. 적용한 규칙이나 사전, 검토한 후보 목록, 추천과 최종 결정 내역, 규칙·모델 버전 등을 적는다."@ko .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/forEntry> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "for entry"@en .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/ColumnRelation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "원본 속성 하나가 어떤 표준 속성에 대응하는지를 기록한 매핑 관계. 원본 경로, 대상 표준 속성, 유사도 점수, 대표값 여부, 우선순위, 판단 근거를 담는다."@ko .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/ofEntry> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "이 원본 속성 항목이 속한 카탈로그엔트리."@ko .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/hasMetadataEntry> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/ofEntry> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The catalog entry this metadata entry belongs to."@en .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/sourcePath> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> _:n9ed5fdded5c049e1a3e6a7febe0b73a3b1 .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/sourcePath> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Path locating the attribute inside the original metadata (JSONPath for JSON, XPath for XML). A metadata entry and a column relation with the same path refer to the same attribute."@en .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/priority> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/representsService> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "이 항목이 나타내는 데이터 서비스(dcat:DataService)."@ko .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/ingestedAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/> .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/rawMetadata> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/hasColumnRelation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has column relation"@en .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/representsDataset> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/rawFormat> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "raw format"@en .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/forEntry> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/ColumnRelation> .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "AMAP: Active Metadata Application Profile"@en .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/CatalogEntry> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "카탈로그에 등록된 데이터 하나를 나타내는 항목. 원본 메타데이터를 그대로 보존하면서 제목·발행자·주제 같은 공통 속성을 DCAT 어휘로 함께 표현하고, 원본 속성 항목(MetadataEntry)과 속성 매핑 관계(ColumnRelation)를 연결하는 기준이 된다."@ko .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/value> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/isPreferred> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "같은 표준 속성에 여러 원본 속성이 대응될 때 대표값으로 쓰는 매핑이면 참. 예: 한국어 제목과 영어 제목이 모두 dct:title에 대응되면 기본 언어 쪽을 참으로 둔다."@ko .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/targetProperty> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://thirdactivedataextech.github.io/terms/amap/evidence> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "판단 근거"@ko .
